00:00:05.738 --> 00:00:06.940 line:0%
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:00:07.073 --> 00:00:09.542 line:0%
You know, over the holidays,
I saw a lot of people,

00:00:09.676 --> 00:00:11.711 line:0%
and I asked them all
the same two questions.

00:00:11.844 --> 00:00:13.780 line:0%
One,
"Have you seen Woody Harrelson?

00:00:13.913 --> 00:00:17.450 line:0%
-He's my ride."
