00:00:17.583 --> 00:00:19.819 line:0%
And... (CHUCKLES) ...two,
"If I said,

00:00:19.952 --> 00:00:23.956 line:0%
'Let's make 2024
the year of blank,'

00:00:24.089 --> 00:00:25.224 line:0%
what would you say?'"

00:00:25.658 --> 00:00:28.661 line:0%
I was surprised.
They all said the same thing.

00:00:28.795 --> 00:00:32.031 line:0%
Sanity. Let's make this
the year of sanity.

00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:34.567 line:0%
-(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)
-Everybody thinks
we've gone bonkers.

00:00:39.038 --> 00:00:42.442
And a lot of it is
because the far ends

00:00:42.575 --> 00:00:43.843
on both Left and Right
have gotten

00:00:43.976 --> 00:00:47.013
way too much attention.
Which begs the question,

00:00:47.146 --> 00:00:49.348
"How do you suck
all the oxygen out of the room,

00:00:49.482 --> 00:00:51.017
and still not get any
to your brain?"

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:55.622
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)
-BILL MAHER: I... (CHUCKLING)

00:00:57.256 --> 00:00:59.158
I feel like
it wasn't that long ago

00:00:59.292 --> 00:01:01.094
when you could watch
cable news for a day,

00:01:01.227 --> 00:01:02.028
and not get the impression

00:01:02.195 --> 00:01:04.130
that this whole place
was totally batshit.

00:01:04.263 --> 00:01:06.533
That simply was not America.

00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:12.572
-Florida, yes, but not America.
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:01:12.705 --> 00:01:16.608
So, let's examine
what makes sane people

00:01:16.742 --> 00:01:17.543
feel this way.

00:01:17.877 --> 00:01:20.746
Sane people who are, after all,
still the vast majority,

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:22.849
and who are the ones,
who I assume,

00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:25.818
