the most trusted man in America.

00:01:25.951 --> 00:01:29.022
-(AUDIENCE CHEERING, APPLAUDING)
-That is a real headline.

00:01:29.155 --> 00:01:32.125
Thank you.
Just call me Billy Cronkite.

00:01:33.893 --> 00:01:38.431
Anyway, what does strike
a sane person as crazy?

00:01:38.798 --> 00:01:40.132
I don't know.
If you're gonna ask me,

00:01:40.266 --> 00:01:42.668
I would start with the fact
that I still occasionally see

00:01:42.802 --> 00:01:44.703
someone driving alone
with a mask on.

00:01:44.837 --> 00:01:49.409
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)
-(CHUCKLES)

00:01:51.644 --> 00:01:53.813
Who-- Who do they think
they're gonna get it from,

00:01:53.946 --> 00:01:55.815
