putting on her makeup?

00:01:55.948 --> 00:01:59.118
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)
-(LAUGHS)

00:01:59.251 --> 00:02:02.421
Or maybe I would say,

00:02:02.554 --> 00:02:05.457
it's the continuing
debt ceiling debate.

00:02:05.824 --> 00:02:07.493
Every time,
a Democrat is president,

00:02:07.627 --> 00:02:10.696
the Republicans threaten
